theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("9_x6x8t")
text = "I started with game development in 2018 with Unity, originaly in 2D I quickly moved to 3D and then VR making all sorts of projects. In 2022 I started at SintLucas in their game development course and learned more about general programming and Unity.

Additionaly I'm also interested in mechanical or technology stuff like cars, computers, weapons and I have of course played a lot of games, my favourite being Shadow of the colossus."
autowrap_mode = 3

