theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("9_x6x8t")
text = "Currently its my freelance company but I eventually want to turn it into a full game studio and publisher.

I'm currently looking for jobs or full-time work and am willing to work internationaly, both remote or on-site for anything in game development.
More specificaly the the part that the player controls. So: movement, weapons, vehicles, physics or anything else the player can do. but I'm also willing to work on other parts"
autowrap_mode = 3

